# The state steps of the format on a Warrior (WarriorRunAwayPhysicalSpecial, 21508, walking and
# attacking), 60 from the character. A hit makes it want to attack the character, and the swing
# step runs its AI until its swing is in flight. The stance step ends its attack stance and
# sets it again; the top step makes the character its top desire target, or nothing; the hp
# steps set the monster's and the character's hit points; the die step kills the character,
# killed by the monster (its death cuts the character's action short).
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.WarriorBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.Warrior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorRunAwayPhysicalSpecial.WarriorRunAwayPhysicalSpecial
npc wolf 21508 Monster 60 0 0 walks

hit wolf 22
  hp wolf 418
swing wolf
stance wolf off
  stance wolf off
stance wolf on
  stance wolf on
top wolf player
  top wolf player
top wolf -
  top wolf -
hp wolf 100
  hp wolf 100
hp player 5
  hp player 5
  dead player no
die wolf
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  dead player yes
